[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    435[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    436[0m:[38;5;10m[49m }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    437[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    438[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// E4 / E5 — `pow` never receives a negative base in either gamma function, so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    439[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// there is no domain error to reproduce. Both guards are exercised at the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    440[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// values that would otherwise go negative.
